===== Q2-e. 슬롯 이동 중(MIGRATING/IMPORTING): ASK와 TRYAGAIN =====
슬롯 5239(키 k:19, n1 소유)를 n2로 옮기는 중인 상태를 손으로 만든다
> [n1 master] redis-cli SET {k:19}:present 1
OK
> [n2 master] redis-cli CLUSTER SETSLOT 5239 IMPORTING 46458afc40e40e5feeb9ea7b5884882f1016c653
OK
> [n1 master] redis-cli CLUSTER SETSLOT 5239 MIGRATING 265f00df2ceac7dca2b21563825eaa3f1ffa9656
OK
> [n1 master] redis-cli FCALL cpeek 1 {k:19}:missing
ASK 5239 10.231.77.12:6379

> [n1 master] redis-cli -c FCALL cpeek 1 {k:19}:missing

265f00df2ceac7dca2b21563825eaa3f1ffa9656
> [n1 master] redis-cli FCALL cpeek 1 {k:19}:present
1
46458afc40e40e5feeb9ea7b5884882f1016c653
> [n1 master] redis-cli FCALL hit2 2 {k:19}:present {k:19}:missing
TRYAGAIN Multiple keys request during rehashing of slot

> [n2 master] redis-cli FCALL cpeek 1 {k:19}:missing
MOVED 5239 10.231.77.11:6379

-- 되돌림
> [n1 master] redis-cli CLUSTER SETSLOT 5239 STABLE
OK
> [n2 master] redis-cli CLUSTER SETSLOT 5239 STABLE
OK
> [n1 master] redis-cli DEL {k:19}:present
1

